{{also|incisión}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fro|incision}}, from {{etyl|LL.|en}} {{m|la|incisio}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɪnˈsɪʒən/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɪʒən|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# A [[cut]], especially one made by a [[scalpel]] or similar medical tool in the context of [[surgery|surgical]] [[operation]].
# The act of incising, or cutting into a substance.
#: {{rfquotek|Milton}}
# {{lb|en|obsolete}} Separation or solution of viscid matter by medicines.

